# Without a root setting, a file's program is that of the newest analysis
# that covers it, else the file's own. Separate programs keep their
# analyses side by side: opening util.tally leaves app.tally's analysis,
# and the diagnostics it gave lib.tally, in place. Opening lib.tally
# analyzes app.tally again, the program that reads it.
initialize
open app.tally
open util.tally
hover app.tally 2:5
hover util.tally 2:4
references util.tally 2:4
open lib.tally
hover lib.tally 1:5
